    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida esezakufa walaya uSolomoni indodana yakhe wathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sengizalandela abaphansi. Ngalokhoke qina, ube yindoda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ugcine umlayo weNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho, uhambe ngezindlela zayo, ugcine izimiso zayo lemithetho yayo lezilayezelo zayo, lamazwi ayo, njengokulotshiweyo emlayweni kaMose, ukuba uphumelele kukho konke okwenzayo lalapho uya khona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuze iNkosi iqinise ilizwi layo eyalikhuluma mayelana lami isithi: Uba amadodana akho eqaphelisa indlela zawo, ehamba ngobuqotho phambi kwami ngenhliziyo yonke langomoya wonke, kawuyikuswela muntu wokubusa uIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi wena uyakwazi okwenziwa kimi nguJowabi indodana kaZeruya, lokuba waziphatha kanjani izinduna ezimbili zezimpi zakoIsrayeli, uAbineri indodana kaNeri loAmasa indodana kaJetheri; wababulala ngesikhathi sokuthula ephindisela igazi elachitheka empini, engcolisa ibhanti elisokhalweni lwami lamanyathelo asezinyaweni zami ngegazi elingelacala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.3.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 3:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhlakaniphe ekwenzeni kwakho, kodwa ungamyekeli aluphale aze afe ngokuthula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa amadodana kaBarizilayi waseGileyadi ube lomusa kuwo, abe ngabanye balabo abadla etafuleni yakho, ngoba ayelomusa kimi ekubalekeleni kwami uAbisalomu umfowenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.17.27+2SA.17.28+2SA.17.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 17:27–29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi kukhona kuwe uShimeyi indodana kaGera wakoBenjamini owaseBahurimi, owangithuka ngenhlamba embi mhla ngisiya eMahanayimi; kodwa kwathi lapho engihlangabeza eJordani ngafunga kuye ngeNkosi ngathi: Kangiyikukubulala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.5+2SA.16.6+2SA.16.7+2SA.16.8+2SA.16.9+2SA.16.10+2SA.16.11+2SA.16.12+2SA.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 16:5–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.19.16+2SA.19.17+2SA.19.18+2SA.19.19+2SA.19.20+2SA.19.21+2SA.19.22+2SA.19.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:16–23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ungamyekeli, ngoba wena ungumuntu ohlakaniphileyo, uzakuzazela wena ozakwenza kuye, afe ngokubulawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesiya kwabaphansi, wangcwatshelwa emzini kaDavida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wabusa koIsrayeli iminyaka engamatshumi amane, wabusa eHebroni iminyaka eyisikhombisa, laseJerusalema iminyaka engamatshumi amathathu lantathu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.4+2SA.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5:4–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Lan 3:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wasebusa esikhundleni sikayise uDavida, lombuso wakhe waqina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Lan 29:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAdonija indodana kaHagithi weza kuBathisheba unina kaSolomoni; yena wathi: Uze ngokuhle na? Wathi: Yebo, ngokuhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAdonija wasesithi: Kukhona engithanda ukukutsho kuwe. UBathisheba wathi: Khuluma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Uyazi ukuba umbuso wawungowami, lokuba abakoIsrayeli bonke babethembe ukuba ngizabusa; kodwa umbuso wangiphunyuka, waba ngowomfowethu, ngoba wawunikwa yiNkosi uNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngilolutho olulodwa engilucela kuwe, ungali. UBathisheba wathi kuye: Ufunani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi: Ngincengela inkosi uSolomoni, kayizukwala kuwe, ukuthi inginike uAbishagi waseShunami abe ngumkami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBathisheba wathi: Kulungile; ngizakukukhulumela enkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uBathisheba wasesiya enkosini uSolomoni ukukhulumela uAdonija. Inkosi yasukuma yamhlangabeza, yakhothama kuye. Yasihlala esihlalweni sayo sobukhosi, yathi kakulethelwe unina wenkosi isihlalo, yena wahlala ngakwesokunene kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Ngilolutho oluncinyane engilucela kuwe, ungali. Inkosi yathi kuye: Cela, mama, ngoba kangiyikwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Ake unike uAdonija umfowenu uAbishagi waseShunami abe ngumkakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uSolomoni yamphendula unina yathi: Ucelelani uAbishagi waseShunami ukuba anikwe uAdonija na? Umcelele lombuso, ngoba ungumnewethu, loAbiyatha umpristi loJowabi indodana kaZeruya bangakuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uSolomoni yasifunga ngeNkosi isithi: UNkulunkulu angihlanekele ngokwengezelelweyo uba lesisicelo singambulalisi uAdonija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke ngifunga iNkosi engimisileyo yangibeka esihlalweni sobukhosi sikaDavida ubaba, yangenzela indlu yobukhosi njengokuthembisa kwayo, uAdonija uzabulawa lamhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uSolomoni yasithuma uBenaya indodana kaJehoyada owamtshaya wambulala uAdonija.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
